# Brewfile
#
# Base packages for ALL Macs (Mac Mini, MacBook Personal, MacBook Work)
# CLI tools, fonts, and shared desktop applications.
#
# Machine-specific packages are in:
#   - Brewfile.macmini          (server/Docker/monitoring tools)
#   - Brewfile.macbook-personal (personal apps, media, creative tools)
#
# Usage:
#   brew bundle --file=~/Brewfile
#
# https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-bundle

